+- `src/demo/customizer-panel.js`：`renderOverviewCard(cfg)` + `updateOverview(container, cfg)` + renderCustomizerGroups 接线
+- `src/styles/customizer.css`：`.cust-overview` 预览卡样式
+- `tests/e2e/customizer.spec.js`：新用例
